Feature: TC_00_DATA - Fill the Test Data Vault before the run

  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # Purpose:
  #   Fetches all the test data the selected test cases will need and stores it in the Test Data Vault
  #   (runtime-data/vault/) BEFORE any browser opens. The ENTS and BISS test cases then take their herds and logins
  #   from the vault in a millisecond instead of running their Oracle queries in the middle of a scenario.
  #
  #   Put this row FIRST in ExecutionControl.xlsx with Execution=Y. It opens no browser and needs no row in
  #   TestData.xlsx. It only connects to the databases in db.properties.
  #
  #   What it does (utilities.DataHarvester):
  #     1. Freshness  - refills the whole jar when data.force.refresh=true, when the jar was filled before the last
  #                     weekly refresh day (data.refresh.day, default MONDAY), or when a database fingerprint changed.
  #     2. Demand     - reads every Execution=Y row and its feature file: which agents, individuals and BISS herds are
  #                     needed, and how many (sections x 2, times data.spare.factor, at least data.min.rows).
  #     3. Fetch      - every pool that is below its target is fetched in parallel (data.threads).
  #     4. Spot check - a few rows of each pool already in the jar are checked against the database.
  #     5. Report     - stock report in the log, Excel copy in runtime-data/vault/TestDataVault_view.xlsx.
  #
  #   The run never fails because a pool is low: the stock report warns, and a test case that finds its pool empty
  #   falls back to the live query exactly as before. It fails only when the database cannot be reached at all.
  #
  # Author : Aniket Pathare | aniket.pathare@government.ie
  # Created: 01-10-2026
  # --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  @data @regression
  Scenario: AT-DATA-00 - Test data is extracted and checked before the test cases run
    Given the test data vault is checked for freshness
    When the test data for every selected test case is extracted
    Then the test data stock report should be printed
